{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_232_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_232","textTraditional":"一、五年。春，城比。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_232_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_232","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊侯伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_232_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_232","textTraditional":"三、晉趙鞅帥師伐衞。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_232_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_232","textTraditional":"四、秋九月癸酉，齊侯處臼卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_232_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_232","textTraditional":"五、冬，叔還如齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_232_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_232","textTraditional":"六、閏月，葬齊景公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_232_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_232","textTraditional":"閏不書，此何以書？喪以閏數也。喪曷為以閏數？喪數略也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}